o<m1_remap> sub
(Remap of M1: [RS274NGC] REMAP = M1 modalgroup=4 argspec=p ngc=m1_remap)
(Pause to Inspect, while Optional Stop is on - motion.digital-in-00 - and the program)
(reaches an M1. P is where the tool waits: P0, or no P, where it is; P1 at G28; P2 at G30.)
(The spindle is stopped, the program stops at the built-in M1; after cycle start the)
(spindle starts again as it was, the tool goes back where it was and the program stops)
(once more, M0, so the operator sees it there before going on.)

    #<where> = 0
    o<p> if [EXISTS[#<p>]]
        #<where> = #<p>
    o<p> endif
    o<valid> if [[#<where> NE 0] AND [#<where> NE 1] AND [#<where> NE 2]]
        (abort, M1: P not allowed. Allowed: P0 or no P - the tool waits where it is, P1 - it waits at G28, P2 - it waits at G30)
    o<valid> endif

    M66 P0 L0 (samples motion.digital-in-00, Optional Stop on, into #5399, no wait)
    o<asked> if [#5399 NE 1]
        o<m1_remap> return
    o<asked> endif

    #<was_diameter> = #<_lathe_diameter_mode>
    #<spindle_on>   = #<_spindle_on>
    #<spindle_cw>   = #<_spindle_cw>
    #<x_return>     = #<_x> (a radius, in G7 too)
    #<z_return>     = #<_z>

    M5 (stop the spindle)
    o<go> if [#<where> EQ 1]
        G28
    o<go> elseif [#<where> EQ 2]
        G30
    o<go> endif
    M1 (built-in M1 inside its own remap: inspect, cycle start to go on)

    o<start> if [#<spindle_on>]
        o<dir> if [#<spindle_cw>]
            M3
        o<dir> else
            M4
        o<dir> endif
    o<start> endif

    G8 (the return point is a radius)
    G0 X#<x_return> Z#<z_return>
    o<mode> if [#<was_diameter>]
        G7
    o<mode> endif

    o<wait> if [#<spindle_on>]
        M66 P1 L3 Q5 (wait max 5 seconds until motion.digital-in-01, spindle at speed, turns ON)
    o<wait> endif
    M0 (back where the tool was: cycle start to go on)

o<m1_remap> endsub
